<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dain Bosworth initiates three.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dain Bosworth initiates three.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Dain Bosworth initiated coverage of PriceCostco Inc with a buy rating on increasing sales momentum and rising gross margins, analyst Diane Daggatt said.</p>
<p>- The brokerage initiated coverage of Boston Beer Co Inc with a hold rating because of the industry's uncertain risk-reward picture, she said.</p>
<p>- The brokerage also initiated coverage of Garden Botanika Inc with a hold, citing weak comparable-store sales.</p>
</text>
